[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27211.75, "timestamp": "07:33:31", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27214.548, "timestamp": "07:33:34", "text": "彼を殺してください。お願い、お願い、お願い"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27220.708, "timestamp": "07:33:40", "text": "魚。私は自分の階級が必要だ。君ならできるよ。はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27222.868, "timestamp": "07:33:42", "text": "待てよ、俺たちは攻撃者なのか？いいえ、負けました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27229.43, "timestamp": "07:33:49", "text": "手伝いに行きましょうか？つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27231.51, "timestamp": "07:33:51", "text": "参加できると思いますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27233.99, "timestamp": "07:33:53", "text": "達人でもあるよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27236.43, "timestamp": "07:33:56", "text": "2番目がより高い場合"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27238.75, "timestamp": "07:33:58", "text": "リーグ"}]